et\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ 2\\cdot 3+5\\cdot -2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186269085 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d383b7d-6127-5405-b283-040260eb65b8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ -25\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186266264} {:answer/id #uuid "34864833-7824-5f46-b27b-f0f7abb0e5a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}25 \\\\ 16\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186266604} {:answer/id #uuid "503694bc-da04-5a62-bada-0dbe4c1808e6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-25 \\\\ 16\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186266857} {:answer/id #uuid "c3e59517-9deb-544d-9b20-012a93bac64d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}25 \\\\ -16\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186267891} {:answer/id #uuid "f837e520-c7ff-587e-beb4-4ef7b053a5d2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ 25\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268342}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}25 \\\\ -16\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186267891} :answer-field/id #uuid "2e0bf285-4fc0-5682-aa9d-c2408af408d5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268484}] :question/id #uuid "9a02491f-bea4-5783-964c-e0eaa7500dd1" :question/math-academy-id "q-13565" :question/problem "Find $Hn$ if \n$H=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$n=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}(-7)\\cdot -3+2\\cdot 2 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}25 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}25 \\\\ 2\\cdot -3+(-5)\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}25 \\\\ -16\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$Hn=\\begin{bmatrix}25 \\\\ -16\\end{bmatrix}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186269105 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3201a9ce-f1a6-5237-801c-f833bd0871e3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 13\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186266584} {:answer/id #uuid "787ca5a5-e42a-5bd0-9e3a-e5d32c87a2c5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}15 \\\\ 13\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186267204} {:answer/id #uuid "e2bf3661-c915-528d-8fa2-24de74440694" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268148} {:answer/id #uuid "f2d9e9cf-bd76-5ec3-ad96-6d7a8553919d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 14\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268302} {:answer/id #uuid "f7f19ca0-1f82-5ae8-9225-1ebfeb0b12cf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}13 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268339}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 13\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186266584} :answer-field/id #uuid "d747729f-6b18-5871-bd2e-48e8e04f2a78" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {: