n/problem "If \n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}b & a & -b \\\\ -b & a & b \\\\ -b & 0 & -b\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$x=\\begin{bmatrix}-b \\\\ 0 \\\\ b\\end{bmatrix},$\nfind $Ax.$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $Ax=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} |  |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =\\begin{bmatrix}b & a & -b \\\\ -b & a & b \\\\ -b & 0 & -b\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-b \\\\ 0 \\\\ b\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (-b) & + & a\\cdot 0 & + & (-b)\\cdot b \\\\ (-b)\\cdot (-b) & + & a\\cdot 0 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,b\\cdot b \\\\ (-b)\\cdot (-b) & + & 0\\cdot 0 & + & (-b)\\cdot b\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}-{b}^{2} & + & 0 & + & (-{b}^{2}) \\\\ {b}^{2} & + & 0 & + & {b}^{2} \\\\ {b}^{2} & + & 0 & + & (-{b}^{2})\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2{b}^{2} \\\\ 2{b}^{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299691 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "576b7488-9297-53f5-bfd3-552c74db1188" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2p" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297917}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2p" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297917} :answer-field/id #uuid "4128ee4f-7636-5d49-98d1-3f22fb5c03f9" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298862} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e24ab5b3-1f64-5dc7-868a-7adaaa849a0f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "np" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298521}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "np" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298521} :answer-field/id #uuid "5dfd7a5e-90ff-561e-a9ad-524ffcfbe024" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-fi