=0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨3,-4,7⟩ & =⟨9,-2,3⟩\\cdot ⟨3,-4,7⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨3,-4,7⟩ & =56.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute $\\mathbf{r}=\\langle x,y,z \\rangle$ into the equation above and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨3,-4,7⟩ & =56 \\\\ 3x-4y+7z & =56 \\\\ 3x-4y+7z-56 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b34272b7-a7ad-5a58-974e-54cca957d06e" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120231 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8e6efa4f-103e-5d09-a0b9-0000c80abb79" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-x + 2y - 5z = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117546} {:answer/id #uuid "db3b50b9-abd4-5dba-9e03-c0800bb6e138" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x - 2y + 5z + 7 = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117547} {:answer/id #uuid "0eeb1aa7-6dff-58c8-b5b2-671e63d7f41a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x + y - 4z - 19 = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117548} {:answer/id #uuid "1d92a7bb-99c9-50e9-9fde-aaa8bacc8638" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x + y - 4z - 7 = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117549} {:answer/id #uuid "79474bef-c5ed-50b0-8a84-65f7dc6ddb2b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x - 2y + 5z + 19 = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117550}] :answer-field/id #uuid "c3139a7d-3108-5452-8a92-6fc4ea874118" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117545}] :question/id #uuid "ef5e0514-3a0a-5e4f-ae1e-e23afafac839" :question/math-academy-id "q-33139" :question/problem "Find a Cartesian equation of the plane that passes through the point $P(3, 1,-4)$ and is perpendicular to the vector $n = i - 2j + 5k$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120285 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8ffe2d5e-1c5c-577a-a451-998f8106110f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.typ